%U A400618 99321,110989,123537,136997,151401,166781,183169,200597,219097,238701,259441,281349,304457
%N A400618 Sum of the distinct entries in the central row and central column of the (2*n + 1) X (2*n + 1) square spiral.
%H A400618 Wikipedia, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ulam_spiral">Ulam spiral</a>.
%F A400618 a(n) = (16*n^3 + 24*n^2 + 20*n + 3)/3.
%e A400618 a(0) = 1.
%e A400618 For n = 1, the array is:
%e A400618   5 4 3
%e A400618   6 1 2
%e A400618   7 8 9,
%e A400618 and a(1) = 4 + 6 + 1 + 2 + 8 = 21.
%o A400618 (PARI) a(n) = (16*n^3 + 24*n^2 + 20*n + 3)/3; \\ _Michel Marcus_, Oct 09 2026
